leted','Validex configuration for OBT Written Assessment.','Successfully configured the passing rate to 60%, set the maximum attempt to 2 and updated some Texts in the output printout result.','10.40.0.10','2025-07-30 05:31:59','2025-07-31 00:25:06'),(770,25,3,6,'Completed','Installation of Adobe Acrobat Reader','Actions taken: Installed Adobe acrobat reader.','10.40.0.10','2025-07-31 06:18:42','2025-07-31 06:37:22'),(771,151,1,3,'Completed','Printer driver is installed but not communicating with the PC.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-07-31 08:17:26','2025-08-01 00:14:12'),(772,153,3,3,'Completed','Printer is installed but not communicating with the PC.','Actions taken: Reconfigured printers network address and reconnected laptop to the printer.','10.40.0.10','2025-07-31 08:18:08','2025-07-31 08:21:37'),(773,232,1,3,'Completed','Print jobs remain stuck in the queue with an error status.','Printer port was set incorrectly, not matching the connected IP port. Reconfigured printer settings to use the correct IP port.','10.40.0.10','2025-07-31 08:24:02','2025-08-01 00:14:28'),(774,202,3,6,'Completed','System unit troubleshooting.','Findings: Boot process halted by a S.M.A.R.T. error message: \'Status bad, backup and replace the drive\".\n\nActions taken:  Disabled SMART status check in the BIOS config.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-01 01:12:47','2025-08-01 06:10:35'),(775,187,1,6,'Completed','Update SIMS',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-01 01:22:59','2025-08-01 03:25:51'),(776,31,3,3,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: Canon G2020 Error: Support code 1726 (Maintenance cartridge).\n\nActions taken: Replaced maintenance cartridge.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-01 02:06:39','2025-08-01 02:14:10'),(777,202,3,6,'Completed','System unit troubleshooting.','Findings: Cannot continue booting the OS—BIOS settings were reset.\n\nAcions taken: Configured BIOS to load default optimal settings.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-01 06:19:27','2025-08-01 06:38:26'),(778,182,1,6,'Completed','In response to your email regarding the request for comments and/or suggestions for the improvement of the PMMA website, I would like to recommend the inclusion of an additional navigation bar labeled \"Downloadable Forms\" in the main menu.\nThis feature will enable both internal and external clients to easily locate, download, and print the necessary forms required when requesting services or information from various offices within the Academy. Only forms relevant and applicable to the clients will be posted under this section, as identified and provided by the respective offices.\n-DPO','The page has already been added to the main menu.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-01 08:12:25','2025-08-27 00:14:05'),(779,25,3,6,'Completed','Installation of Epson L360 scanner app.','Actions taken: Installed Epson scan app.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-01 08:20:33','2025-08-01 08:39:40'),(780,16,3,3,'Completed','The printer frequently displays a \"machine failure\" error. During the last occurrence, the KYOCERA operator mentioned that the issue may be related to electrical voltage fluctuations. We attempted to address this by using an AVR, however, we noticed a persistent noise coming from the AVR every time we print, which suggests that the voltage supply may still be unstable or insufficient.','Actions taken: No machine failure was found upon checking. Using AVR is advisable during power fluctuations. The noise it makes is normal as it stabilizes the voltage.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-04 02:50:40','2025-08-04 07:43:29'),(781,22,3,6,'Completed','Printer troubleshooting','Findings: No power.\n\nActions taken: Loose connection (power cable)','10.40.0.10','2025-08-04 02:58:35','2025-08-04 05:27:35'),(782,197,1,2,'Completed','Check status of laptop issued to Mr. Angelo Pocopio returned by Engr. Alessandro Ong.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-04 05:58:56','2025-08-04 07:19:19'),(783,32,3,6,'Completed','No internet connectivity and expired user login password.','Findings: User password not accepted in the captive portal.\n\nActions taken: Password reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-04 07:31:04','2025-08-04 07:45:47'),(784,122,5,6,'Completed','Cannot generate payroll in SIMS','Findings: The auto update of MS Access affected deployment. \nAction Taken: Uninstalled Office productivity tools, downgraded to an earlier version, and reinstalled the MS Access Runtime.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-05 01:40:29','2025-08-05 06:35:09'),(785,119,0,6,'Completed','PSIPOP Configuration','Set Internet Explorer as default browser for PSIPOP URL.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 00:09:58','2025-08-06 00:20:30'),(786,153,1,3,'Completed','unable to print',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 00:11:03','2025-08-06 03:27:59'),(787,215,3,6,'Completed','\"Enter the code displayed in the authenticator app on your mobile device​​.\"','Actions taken: Entered the code generated by the Microsoft Authenticator app. (outloook is working after entering code)','10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 00:28:26','2025-08-06 02:57:48'),(788,6,3,2,'Completed','Computer won\'t start after a Blue screen error','Actions taken: Performed system reboot.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 01:19:41','2025-08-06 02:58:18'),(789,30,3,2,'Completed','Keyboard is not working.','Actions taken: Performed system reboot. Problem resolved after reboot.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 01:55:05','2025-08-06 02:55:34'),(790,30,3,6,'Completed','Desktop no internet connection.','Findings: Loose connection on the UTP cable.\n\nActions taken: Securely reconnected the UTP cable.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 02:54:33','2025-08-06 02:59:58'),(791,7,5,4,'Completed','Update of eNGAS.','Action Take: We recommend create ticket in eNgas. please see attached database. https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JvQbxpJ6mVkWc3uVLcHZ09PkhQhBs6b9?usp=drive_link','10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 06:02:44','2025-08-06 07:53:38'),(792,120,3,2,'Completed','Existing or searched file cannot be accessed\r\nComputer is running slow','Actions taken: Installed SSD; installed OS, installed standard software, installed windows updates, installed utility drivers, restored office files.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-06 08:31:45','2025-08-08 04:05:20'),(793,105,1,2,'Completed','Hello Ma\'am/Sir, \r\nMay we respectfully request your assistance po. Ma\'am Viki asked me po to open her computer to get some files po. Naopen ko naman po yung computer, however, naopen lang po siya. Hindi po nag appear yug cursor ng mouse, tsaka yung log in credentials. Thank you so much po.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-07 01:23:14','2025-08-07 02:41:24'),(794,187,5,6,'Completed','SIMS- \"Preview\" button isn\'t working.','Findings: Microsoft access not supported by application.\nAction Taken: \n>Stop automatic microsoft access update.\n>Resintatall microsoft access 2000 runtime.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-08 00:18:50','2025-08-08 00:38:12'),(795,175,3,4,'Completed','Unable to access files in outlook, even in downloading the file as well. \r\nAnydesk: 1347945337','Findings: Could not view or download file using outlook app, possibly due to an issue with the Microsoft application.\n\nActions taken: Opened outlook email via browser instead.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-08 00:29:37','2025-08-08 01:40:06'),(796,187,3,6,'Completed','SIMS update','Actions taken: Downloaded biometrics logs and updated SIMS.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-08 02:12:53','2025-08-08 04:04:09'),(797,131,3,1,'Completed','Request for LAN installation at SanDagat Building.','Actions taken: LAN connection was already set up; added a wireless router to enable laptop connectivity.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-08 06:40:25','2025-08-19 00:51:07'),(798,185,1,2,'Completed','Issue: System unit not turning on.\r\nFindings: Loose motherboard power cable connection.\r\nAction Taken: Checked and reconnected motherboard cables; reseated RAM; system unit powered on successfully.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-11 08:03:22','2025-08-11 08:30:13'),(799,29,4,6,'Completed','Set up AV equipment in the OOS for the meeting.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-12 00:15:23','2025-08-13 01:39:37'),(800,16,3,3,'Completed','unable to access the