hen replaced.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-13 00:03:33','2025-08-13 02:21:47'),(808,17,0,3,'Completed','Can not print','Findings: Cannot detect the printer via network. Action Taken: Installed Epson L5290 driver locally.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-13 06:02:22','2025-08-13 07:24:04'),(809,17,3,1,'Completed','Intermittent Wi-Fi connection/signal.','Findings: Weak WiFi signal strength in the user\'s area.\n\nActions taken: User connected via newly installed UTP cable directly to the network switch, bypassing weak wifi.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-14 02:07:06','2025-08-18 03:50:13'),(810,174,0,5,'Completed','Television is not turning on.','Findings: Power cord is not connected properly. Action Taken: Re-plugged the power cable and configured the hdmi connection to the laptop.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-18 00:41:32','2025-08-18 00:42:54'),(811,106,NULL,5,'Cancelled','UPS has been making a beeping sound since last week.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-18 01:08:03','2025-08-18 01:28:13'),(812,6,3,6,'Completed','Request assistance (installation of Firefox browser)','Actions taken: Installed old version of Firefox as requirement for the online remmitance.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-18 01:51:15','2025-08-18 02:15:38'),(813,105,0,6,'Completed','PNPKI How-To\'s.','Findings: PNPKI already installed in the Laptop. Action Taken: Provided instruction on how to use/apply the digital signature in pdf files.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-18 05:55:45','2025-08-18 05:57:08'),(814,196,3,6,'Completed','PC troubleshooting.','Findings: Old account is loaded (selected primary drive is incorrect).\n\nActiions taken: Verified BIOS configuration and set the correct boot device.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-18 06:18:34','2025-08-18 07:22:50'),(815,35,3,2,'Completed','The computer screen is flickering with green color.','Findings: Loose VGA cable connection detected on the system unit. Secured cable screw.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-18 09:07:47','2025-08-19 00:27:59'),(816,37,3,6,'Completed','Assistance with the replacement of the dot matrix printer ribbon.','Actions taken: Installed a new ribbon for the dot matrix printer.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 00:23:44','2025-08-19 00:29:25'),(817,34,3,4,'Completed','Unable to access or open all excel file. With window prompt \"updating microsoft 365 and office...\" then another window prompt \"the application was unable to start...\"','Findings: \"EXCEL.EXE Application error0xc0000142.\r\n\r\nActions taken: Modified App in the App and Features settings.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 00:47:42','2025-08-19 01:18:22'),(818,32,0,2,'Completed','Cannot boot up to windows.','Findings: The keyboard is malfunctioning.. Action Taken: Used an alternative keyboard and advised the user to request a replacement at the SPMU.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 00:52:58','2025-08-19 00:55:30'),(819,90,3,1,'Completed','Slow Internet Connection at the DMA Conference Room','Actions taken: Checked the WiFi connection and found that when all doors are closed, the signal weakens, resulting in a very slow connection. End users decided to purchase a wireless router as a temporary solution to address the issue.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 05:16:33','2025-08-20 06:33:31'),(820,112,3,3,'Completed','Printer is not printing in color.','Findings: Performed printer maintenance, but the output issue persists. (Printer head needs to be checked.)\n\nActions taken: Temporarily connected user to the shared printer.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 05:18:14','2025-08-20 01:46:12'),(821,35,0,2,'Completed','Problem with monitor display.','Findings: The monitor flickers intermittently and displays distorted, inaccurate colors. Recommendation: Replacing the monitor (Samsung 2024-IC-6258) due to potential hardware failure.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 07:41:38','2025-08-19 07:47:55'),(822,35,0,5,'Completed','UPS has no back-up power.','Findings: APC (Serial #: 9B2211A24413) UPS failure was identified as battery degradation that causes no backup power.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 07:49:43','2025-08-20 06:26:20'),(823,189,3,1,'Completed','no network','Due to the user’s unavailability caused by an emergency, they requested to close the ticket and reopen it once the user is available.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 08:01:45','2025-08-20 03:25:29'),(824,175,3,3,'Completed','The printer technician (kyocera printer) needs further assistance regarding the IP address of PMMA.','Actions taken: Relocation of the network printer including the network cable. Reconfigured the IP address to allow users to connect to the printer.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 08:24:32','2025-08-20 01:43:01'),(825,166,1,3,'Completed','We experienced a problem with printing even though the laptop and the printer are connected to the same Wi-Fi network.','Findings:*Printer is installed but not communicating with the PC. Actions Taken:*Identified correct communication port (USB/COM/IP depending on setup).*Restarted print spooler service.*Performed test print — printer responded successfully.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 08:33:53','2025-08-20 01:55:45'),(826,166,1,3,'Completed','We experienced a problem with printing even though the laptop and the printer are connected to the same Wi-Fi network.','Findings: *Print jobs remain stuck in the queue. Actions Taken:*Identified correct communication port (USB/COM/IP depending on setup).*Reconfigured printer settings to use the correct port.*Performed test print — printer responded successfully.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-19 08:33:56','2025-08-20 01:53:05'),(827,228,3,3,'Completed','The printed output appears unclear. Kindly bring a cleaning brush for printer maintenance','Findings: Printer output shows streaks/lines with dirt marks.\n\nActions taken: Requested the Supply Office to coordinate with Philcopy for printer support.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-20 00:49:38','2025-08-20 02:53:58'),(828,7,0,4,'Completed','Installation of PNPKI','Successfully installed the .p12 file and Foxit Reader application, created a tailored digital certificate signature, and demonstrated on how to sign a document.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-20 02:20:06','2025-08-20 06:12:21'),(829,101,3,1,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: No internet connectivity.\n\nActions taken: Conducted a network check and discovered that the uplink connection at the network switch was down; reassigned the connection to a different port.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-20 03:23:56','2025-08-20 03:32:30'),(830,33,1,4,'Completed','Assistance with Canva Application.','Actions taken: Granted access to the Canva app.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-20 05:18:59','2025-08-26 08:48:49'),(831,192,0,6,'Completed','Operate the auto-mailer macro.','Reviewed and audited the format and path of the Mailer macro. Sending of messages of the mailer is now functioning.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-20 08:25:03','2025-08-26 07:14:58'),(832,166,5,6,'Completed','I forgot the password of the outlook of the Office of the Board Secretary, I requested to reset the password of the OBS outlook.','Action Findings: Please verify if the users are authenticated and reset their default passwords.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-20 08:37:41','2025-08-20 08:39:35'),(833,16,4,6,'Completed','requesting support at hotel for orientation on new forms',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-26 00:23:27','2025-08-26 01:27:40'),(834,16,4,6,'Completed','requesting support at hotel for orientation on new forms',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-26 00:23:30','2025-08-26 01:27:46'),(835,16,4,6,'Completed','requesting support at hotel for orientation on new forms',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-08-26 00:23:32','2025-08-26 01:27:51'),(836,187,3,6,'Completed','SIMS update','Actions taken: Downloaded biometrics logs and updated SIMS.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-26 01:28:09','2025-08-26 02:15:29'),(837,199,3,6,'Completed','Could not access Yahoo mail.','Actions taken: Checked the user’s report regarding his Yahoo Mail, but upon verification, the mail was already working.','10.40.0.10','2025-08-26 02:55:28','2025-08-26 03:03:56'),(838,22,3,2,'Completed','The system is unable to boot.','Actions taken: Performed initial power troubleshooting