pdated SIMS.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 00:45:28','2025-09-01 01:51:38'),(867,187,5,6,'Completed','Reactivation of Email of Marriane Kate Rosete (for files restoration)','Action Taken: Password reset and account reactivation. This is the default password: Pmma@1820','10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 03:04:33','2025-09-01 03:14:00'),(868,35,3,1,'Completed','Desktop no internet connectivity.','Findings: No internet connectivity.\nActions taken: Logged in account to the captive portal.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 03:06:46','2025-09-01 03:19:52'),(869,139,3,3,'Completed','Cannot detect printer','Printer was already working when I arrived. The user said they just rebooted the laptop.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 04:14:22','2025-09-02 00:12:07'),(870,90,4,1,'Completed','Unable to connect to the networks',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 04:51:47','2025-09-01 05:07:07'),(871,11,1,1,'Completed','Unable to connect to the network','Findings: Device unable to connect to the network due to the old SSID being inactive.\r\nAction Taken: Reconnected the device to the newly configured SSID, restoring network connectivity.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 05:32:09','2025-09-01 06:18:02'),(872,175,3,3,'Completed','Connect the laptop of the remaining planning personnel (Engr Viernes & C/E Salmon) to the newly repaired kyocera printer.','Actions taken: Installed printer driver and connected devices to the network printer (Kyocera).','10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 06:56:18','2025-09-01 07:39:53'),(873,175,3,6,'Completed','To fill up pre/post evaluation repair of Kyocera printer.','Actions taken: Filled up pre and post evaluation report on the repair of Kyocera printer.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-01 07:41:07','2025-09-01 07:44:02'),(874,187,5,6,'Completed','Reactivation of Account of Jenn Rose Soon ( For Using of SIMS and Extracting Files).','Action Taken: Reset password Pmma#0281','10.40.0.10','2025-09-02 00:16:26','2025-09-02 00:25:28'),(875,16,3,6,'Completed','cannot access BAC shared folder','The shared folder was already accessible when I arrived.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-02 02:58:41','2025-09-02 03:19:28'),(876,142,3,1,'Completed','Unable to connect to the network','Actions taken: Connected device to the PMMA-PERSONNEL ssid.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-02 06:53:59','2025-09-02 08:13:57'),(877,250,0,6,'Completed','Pmma password account reset','Successfully reset PMMA email account.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-03 01:14:32','2025-09-03 01:15:23'),(878,251,0,6,'Completed','Pmma password acc reset','Successfully reset PMMA email account.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-03 01:26:10','2025-09-03 01:26:22'),(879,131,1,6,'Completed','LAN Connection at Sandagat Building','Findings:\r\nExisting switch was active, but the specific PC had no UTP connection to the switch; VLAN and printer setup also required.\r\n\r\nAction Taken:\r\nLaid UTP cable from the switch to the affected PC. Configured managed switch and created VLANs for the Accounting network and IP phone. Configured printer on the PC. Verified stable internet, IP phone, and printing functionality.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-03 03:07:52','2025-09-04 04:40:18'),(880,31,3,1,'Completed','No wireless internet access.','Findings: Internet connection unavailable on VLAN1.\n\nActions taken: Configure VLAN settings to VLAN20 (Personnel VLAN).','10.40.0.10','2025-09-03 03:20:02','2025-09-03 05:25:54'),(881,131,3,1,'Completed','No wireless internet connection.','Findings: Internet connection unavailable on VLAN1. (Sandagat)\n\nActions taken: Configure VLAN settings to VLAN20 (Personnel VLAN).','10.40.0.10','2025-09-03 03:20:51','2025-09-03 05:26:45'),(882,119,5,6,'Completed','Restoration of Pag Ibig and Landbank Deduction in SIMS','Findings: Lost data Pagibig and Landbank in main database.\nAction Taken:\n>Backup main database\n>Restore backup database 09/03/2025 0600H\n>Formulate syntax for the restoration\n>Restore Pagibig database successfully\n>Restore Landbank database sucessfully','10.40.0.10','2025-09-03 03:50:46','2025-09-03 04:30:00'),(883,119,5,6,'Completed','Restoration of Pag Ibig and Landbank Deduction in SIMS','Findings: Lost data Pagibig and Landbank in main database.\nAction Taken:\n>Backup main database\n>Restore backup database 09/03/2025 0600H\n>Formulate syntax for the restoration\n>Restore Pagibig database success\n>Restore Landbank database success','10.40.0.10','2025-09-03 03:50:48','2025-09-03 04:30:13'),(884,195,3,1,'Completed','Unable to connect to the Personnel network as it requires a password.','The laptop already had an internet connection when I arrived.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-04 00:06:36','2025-09-04 05:53:32'),(885,187,3,3,'Completed','Cannot print documents.','Findings: Blinking lights detected on Power, Ink, and Paper indicators.\n\nActions taken: The disc sensor had accumulated dirt and was cleaned to restore proper function.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-04 01:30:56','2025-09-09 06:18:01'),(886,175,3,3,'Completed','Printing error, no wifi connection','Actions taken: Deleted pending print jobs from the queue and performed a system reboot.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-04 02:50:03','2025-09-04 05:22:30'),(887,2,5,1,'Completed','unable to upload in EBCS\r\n1701645534','Findings: EBCS website problem. \nAction Taken: \n>Test to other internet provider\n>Clear caching \n>Use different Browser\n>Reload to different device','10.40.0.10','2025-09-05 02:25:35','2025-09-06 01:05:24'),(888,105,0,3,'Completed','Last August 29, Sir Marlon was able to bring the repaired unit to our office and even conducted a test print. At that time, the cyan and yellow colors were already visible in the test print copy. However, when we attempted to print a certificate afterward, both colors were no longer visible. On the same day, August 29, the printer was returned to your office for repair. In this regard, may we request your immediate assistance as we don\'t have any printer left in the office. Thank you and we appreciate you. :)','Findings: Cyan and Yellow color is not printing again, the printhead might have an internal damage. Actions Taken: Cleaned and ink flush the printer cartridge. Cyan and Yellow are now showing in the print-outs. Recommendation: Observe the printer performance again.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-05 02:43:22','2025-09-08 01:41:41'),(889,105,0,3,'Cancelled','Last August 29, Sir Marlon was able to bring the repaired unit to our office and even conducted a test print. At that time, the cyan and yellow colors were already visible in the test print copy. However, when we attempted to print a certificate afterward, both colors were no longer visible. On the same day, August 29, the printer was returned to your office for repair. In this regard, may we request your immediate assistance as we don\'t have any printer left in the office. Thank you and we appreciate you. :)','Duplicate request. Ticket 888.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-05 02:43:26','2025-09-08 01:42:26'),(890,189,3,1,'Completed','No network (LAN)','Actions taken: RJ45 jacks were recrimped, and the account was logged in to the captive portal.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-09 00:21:47','2025-09-09 01:24:31'),(891,182,3,6,'Completed','Request for a Job Order Report on the Malfunctioning Scanner.','The Epson DS-570W II scanner has been experiencing frequent intermittent disconnections. Troubleshooting and maintenance were already performed, including driver reinstallation and hardware checks, but the problems persist. As the unit has been in service for several years, wear and tear have contributed to its deteriorating condition. These recurring issues cause delays in document processing and reduce office efficiency.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-09 01:26:39','2025-09-09 01:52:59'),(892,198,3,6,'Completed','SSD installation.','Findings: The system is experiencing slow performance.\n\nActions taken: Installed SSD; installed OS, office 365, standard software, windows updates, utility drivers and restored office files.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-09 06:18:39','2025-09-09 23:55:57'),(893,116,3,3,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: Printer error: Ink absorber pad is full, error code 1700 detected.\n\nActions taken: Ink absorber pad was replaced and the error code was reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-09 06:50:48','2025-09-16 05:41:48'),(894,102,1,3,'Completed',NULL,'HP InkTank 115 unable to print black.\r\nFindings:\r\nAir was detected in the black ink tube, preventing ink from flowing properly. No available tool to perform ink suction directly through the cartridge.\r\nAction Taken:\r\nAttempted troubleshooting using available methods; unable to fully remove the air from the black ink tube.\r\nRecommendation:\r\nPerform ink system priming/cleaning once the proper tool becomes available, or escalate to an authorized service center for servicing.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-10 01:06:56','2025-09-11 02:01:50'),(895,229,1,6,'Completed','legal unit outlook account','Email Account Created for Legal Unit','10.40.0.10','2025-09-10 01:08:08','2025-09-11 01:48:28'),(896,7,3,6,'Completed','Uninstall wps app 1355764644','Actions taken: Uninstalled WPS app.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-10 05:25:59','2025-09-10 06:21:50'),(897,252,3,6,'Completed','Office365 not working.','Actions taken: User authentication to Office 365 using the PMMA account was completed.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-10 08:38:42','2025-09-10 08:40:49'),(898,25,3,1,'Completed','No internet connection','Findings: The UTP LAN cable exhibited signs of wear and required replacement.\n\nActions taken: Replacement of the worn UTP cable was completed.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 00:32:09','2025-09-11 01:48:36'),(899,139,0,4,'Completed','Printer software installation.','Successfully installed Canon G4010 and Kyocera Ecosys2100wcfx drivers.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 00:57:00','2025-09-11 02:15:23'),(900,149,3,6,'Completed','Request transfer of IP phone from Nurse quarters to front desk.','Actions taken: Completed transfer of the IP phone from nurse quarters to the front desk.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 01:50:12','2025-09-11 03:15:23'),(901,82,1,3,'Completed',NULL,'Issue:\r\nPrinter not printing properly.\r\nFindings:\r\nNo driver was installed, preventing the use of the Epson cleaning tool.\r\nAction Taken:\r\nInstalled the correct Epson printer driver and performed head cleaning using the Epson software cleaning tool, restoring proper print quality.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 02:33:23','2025-09-11 05:28:53'),(902,82,NULL,3,'Cancelled',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 02:33:25','2025-09-11 05:32:35'),(903,111,3,3,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: Printed output is missing color.\n\nActions taken: Performed thorough troubleshooting and maintenance, but the issue remains unresolved. Requested Supply Unit for external maintenance support for expert evaluation to identify the root cause of the printer problem and provide recommendations.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 03:17:29','2025-10-09 11:47:45'),(904,139,4,3,'Completed','There is an unserviceable printer in the library that needs to be identified as to whether it is repairable or not. The result will serve as the basis for determining whether to turn over the equipment to the Supply Unit or not.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 05:58:32','2025-09-13 01:47:07'),(905,139,4,3,'Completed','There is an unserviceable printer in the library that needs to be identified as to whether it is repairable or not. The result will serve as the basis for determining whether to turn over the equipment to the Supply Unit or not.','The roller mechanism of the Canon Printer Model N2004 is no longer functioning as expected. This issue has resulted in consistent paper feeding failures during print and scan operations, causing interruptions in daily tasks.     \r\n\r\nIt is recommended to replace the roller unit of the Canon Printer N2004 as soon as possible to restore normal operation. If a replacement roller is not readily available or if the cost of repair is high, replacing the entire printer unit may be a more efficient long-term solution.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-11 05:58:36','2025-09-13 01:45:27'),(906,254,3,6,'Completed','To Unblock account','Findings: Unable to connect to the internet due to a blocked account.\n\nActions taken: Unblocked account.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 01:18:30','2025-09-15 01:25:37'),(907,253,3,6,'Completed','TO UNBLOCK ACCOUNT',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 01:18:31','2025-09-15 06:15:49'),(908,153,4,1,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 01:22:16','2025-09-15 06:16:07'),(909,9,1,3,'Completed','Request technical assistance regarding the printer of Maam Avelina. According to Maam the printer is producing blurry printouts, which affects the quality of the documents.','Issue:\r\nPrinter unable to print correctly; output still distorted/incomplete.\r\n\r\nFindings:\r\nPossible clogged nozzles or hardware malfunction.\r\n\r\nAction Taken:\r\nPerformed thorough troubleshooting including cleaning of ink tubes, print head, nozzle declogging, and deep cleaning via printer software. Despite these actions, the issue persisted.\r\n\r\nRecommendation:\r\nProceed with replacing the ink cartridges or print head assembly as the next step in resolving the issue.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 01:39:29','2025-10-13 00:16:42'),(910,233,3,6,'Completed','Update SIMS',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 02:12:49','2025-09-15 07:33:40'),(911,255,3,6,'Completed','To unblocked account','Findings: Unable to connect to the internet due to a blocked account. Actions taken: Unblocked account.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 03:19:41','2025-09-15 03:21:41'),(912,215,4,3,'Completed','Connect Laptop to Printer',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 03:38:46','2025-09-15 06:32:39'),(913,256,3,6,'Completed','To unblock account','Findings: Unable to connect to the internet due to a blocked account. Actions taken: Unblocked account.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 05:21:25','2025-09-15 05:22:16'),(914,257,3,6,'Completed','TO UNBLOCK ACCOUNT','Findings: Unable to connect to the internet due to a blocked account. Actions taken: Unblocked account.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-15 05:28:27','2025-09-15 05:34:23'),(915,258,3,6,'Completed',