-16 07:37:35','2025-09-16 07:37:52'),(933,139,3,3,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: The document failed to print in the correct format. Although the setting was configured to landscape, the output printed in portrait orientation.\n\nActions taken: Reinstalled the printer driver.\n\nStatus:\nPrinter is now functioning properly and prints in the correct format.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-16 08:21:31','2025-09-17 06:28:17'),(934,116,3,6,'Completed','Could not connect to the shared printer.\nTo connect laptop to the shared pritner.','Findings: The printer’s data connector was loose.\n\nActions taken: Reinserted and secured the data cable; connected laptop to the shared printer.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-17 03:00:19','2025-09-17 05:14:52'),(935,184,4,5,'Completed','Blue Screen Issue',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-09-18 00:52:29','2025-09-18 03:30:24'),(936,273,0,6,'Completed','Microsoft outlook password reset.','Successfully reset PMMA email account and disabled multi-factor authenticator.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-18 05:28:54','2025-09-18 05:32:18'),(937,74,0,3,'Cancelled','The printer belt is loose.','Advised to inquire to SPMU regarding spare printer belt.','10.40.0.10','2025-09-19 01:19:27','2025-10-10 01:48:42'),(938,274,5,1,'Completed','Reset account password','Password Reset','10.40.0.10','2025-09-19 06:00:12','2025-09-19 06:01:07'),(939,275,5,6,'Completed','Request to reset password','Reset password','10.40.0.10','2025-09-19 06:46:48','2025-09-19 07:20:45'),(940,276,5,2,'Completed','TEST TEST','Test support','10.40.0.10','2025-09-22 08:39:36','2025-09-23 00:49:43'),(941,277,5,6,'Completed','My password for pmma account is forgotten so I cannot access my outlook and Microsoft 365 accounts. Please reset','Reset password','10.40.0.10','2025-09-22 08:41:12','2025-09-23 00:50:21'),(942,278,5,6,'Completed','Dear Sir/Ma\'am,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to kindly request assistance regarding my account password, as I have unfortunately forgotten it.\r\nCould you pl