able to access MS TEAMS and OUTLOOK. Incorrect password','Actions taken: Performed password reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 00:14:43','2025-10-28 00:22:42'),(1394,336,3,6,'Completed','Cannot login to outlook','Actions taken: Performed password reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 00:24:11','2025-10-28 00:34:37'),(1395,9,3,2,'Completed','UPS not working.','Findings: Desktop UPS keeps beeping. (Drained battery)\n\nActions taken: Disconnected the UPS load and recharged the battery for a minute, then reconnected the load.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 01:15:21','2025-10-28 02:04:39'),(1396,35,3,1,'Completed',NULL,'Actions taken: Connected laptop to the PMMA-PERSONNEL ssid.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 01:59:41','2025-10-28 02:05:20'),(1397,528,3,6,'Completed','Reconnection of PMMA WIFI from blockage due to suspicious use of VPN or restricted applications.','Findings: Internet was blocked due to use of VPN.\n\nActions taken: Unblocked account.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 02:02:18','2025-10-28 02:06:35'),(1398,271,NULL,6,'Cancelled','I forgot the password in my Microsoft account.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 05:38:46','2025-11-04 03:03:44'),(1399,90,4,5,'Completed','phone at the quarter deck is not working',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 06:01:31','2025-10-29 01:57:26'),(1400,8,3,1,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: No active LAN or Internet connection.\n\nActions taken: Reassigned the uplink connection to a different switch port.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 07:10:51','2025-10-28 07:33:31'),(1401,16,3,2,'Completed','it takes time to print documents, \"word not responding\" appears on the screen.','Findings: Unable to establish a connection with the local printer. (Printing failed due to incorrect printer choice)\n\nActions taken: Configured printing to use the default local printer.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-28 07:31:47','2025-10-28 07:52:14'),(1402,516,5,6,'Completed','Forgot password Microsoft Teams','Password reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-29 00:27:03','2025-10-29 01:58:12'),(1403,30,4,6,'Completed','UPS for dispossal','The battery is depleted, and non-functional / Device is Unserviceable','10.40.0.10','2025-10-29 02:17:01','2025-10-29 02:45:08'),(1404,228,5,6,'Completed','Unable to obtain code from authenticator app',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-10-29 07:55:37','2025-11-04 02:55:20'),(1405,228,5,6,'Completed','Unable to obtain code from authenticator app',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-10-29 07:55:40','2025-11-04 02:55:07'),(1406,183,1,1,'Completed','Wireless network is not working in Ampi','Actions taken: Restarted router.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-30 00:03:38','2025-11-04 02:53:51'),(1407,233,1,6,'Completed','update sims, thank you',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-10-30 01:37:57','2025-10-30 03:19:12'),(1408,182,NULL,4,'Completed','Installation of pdf reader/editor software',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-10-30 03:19:20','2025-11-04 02:57:51'),(1409,204,1,6,'Completed','CCTV camera not working.','Findings:\r\nUpon inspection, the CCTV camera mounted on the pole was found detached from its proper position and hanging loosely. The protective glass covering the lens is broken, allowing moisture to enter the camera housing. This exposure likely caused internal condensation and signal failure.\r\nAction Taken:\r\nChecked the camera’s physical mount, power, and network connections. Confirmed that the camera is not transmitting video due to moisture damage and broken lens cover.\r\nRecommendation:\r\nReplace the damaged CCTV camera and re-secure its mounting. Ensure the new unit has a properly sealed housing to prevent water ingress and maintain reliable operation.','10.40.0.10','2025-10-30 03:32:10','2025-10-30 03:32:27'),(1410,530,5,6,'Completed','Hello sir/ma\'am good morning/afternoon/evening, I\'m here to report about my Account 15162@cdt.pmma.edu.ph, i can\'t change the password of my account sir/ma\'am and I can\'t login sir/ma\'am, I hope you can help me with this sir/ma\'am.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-10-30 07:14:38','2025-11-04 05:06:29'),(1411,530,5,6,'Completed','Request Id: 91b6aaf8-427a-481b-8fff-2eb3f4f6fd00\r\nCorrelation Id: d3a1b4b6-39b3-4757-9411-a600cd74db30\r\nTimestamp: 2025-11-03T12:05:45Z\r\nMessage: AADSTS900561: The endpoint only accepts POST requests. Received a GET request.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-03 12:08:49','2025-11-04 05:06:01'),(1412,189,1,1,'Completed','All our laptops in the Registrar can\'t connect to the wireless network. Please expidite.','Actions taken: Restarted router.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-04 00:15:48','2025-11-04 02:55:51'),(1413,70,4,1,'Completed','currently no internet access in the Department of Midshipmen Affairs (DMA) area.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-04 02:46:12','2025-11-04 03:02:22'),(1414,14,1,2,'Completed','Activation and testing of 7 units of newly delivered Laptops.','Issue: Newly delivered laptops require activation and testing prior to use.\r\nFindings: Units are in good condition with no physical or software issues observed.\r\nAction Taken: Activated and tested seven (7) newly delivered laptops; verified functionality of hardware components and pre-installed software. Added all units to the Active Directory/domain for centralized management and user access control.\r\nStatus: Completed and ready for deployment.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 01:01:46','2025-11-05 01:28:32'),(1415,82,4,6,'Completed','Cannot access the eNGAS.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 01:39:20','2025-11-05 06:34:20'),(1416,14,3,6,'Completed','Please check the remaining seven new laptops and install the necessary software and updates.','Checked the laptops and installed the required applications, Windows updates, and AnyConnect VPN.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 02:23:32','2025-11-06 00:44:25'),(1417,131,1,6,'Completed','Inspection and troubleshooting of the desktop computer used by Internal Auditor I, Jayvee F. Torres, due to performance issues such as lagging and slow performance.','Issue: Evaluation of the desktop computer due to lagging and slow performance.\r\nFindings: Upon inspection, the unit is running Windows 10 Enterprise with an Intel Core i5-4400 processor and 12GB RAM. The system exhibits sluggish performance, likely caused by an aging mechanical HDD and background processes.\r\nAction Taken: Conducted performance assessment and optimization; verified system specifications and condition for documentation.\r\nRecommendation: Replacement with a laptop is recommended to enhance mobility and productivity. Upgrading to an SSD is also advisable if the desktop will be retained for other tasks.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 02:37:39','2025-11-05 06:19:25'),(1418,131,3,6,'Completed','Inspection and troubleshooting of laptop used by Internal Auditor Head, Beverly Ann A. Asuncion, due to performance issues such as lagging, slow operation and rapidly draining battery.','Findings: The unit is still functional but performs very slowly and its battery no longer charges, requiring it to be plugged in at all times. While replacing the battery pack may temporarily restore limited use, the laptop’s outdated hardware makes it nearly obsolete and unsuitable for current operational needs.\n\nRecommendation:\nThe unit is recommended for condemnation due to obsolescence. However, usable parts such as the RAM, hard drive, or display may be salvaged and transferred to other laptops of the same model to extend their service life.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 02:40:55','2025-11-07 01:58:54'),(1419,120,1,2,'Completed','Make a report for turnover to Supply.','Issue: End user requested evaluation of the desktop computer due to lagging and slow performance.\r\nFindings: Upon inspection, the system unit is running Windows 11 Enterprise with an Intel Core i5-4400 (4th Gen) processor and 4GB RAM. The system exhibits noticeable slow response times and frequent freezing during normal operations. Hardware assessment indicates that the processor and other internal components are outdated and no longer supported by most modern software and security updates, leading to reduced efficiency and reliability. The monitor, however, remains fully functional and may still be reused.\r\nRecommendation: Replacement of the system unit is strongly recommended, as upgrading the existing components would not be cost-effective','10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 02:46:59','2025-11-11 02:54:28'),(1420,3,NULL,6,'Cancelled','My DTS Password is not working, kindly help me create new password. TYI',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 02:50:07','2025-11-05 03:10:35'),(1421,150,1,6,'Completed','Connect the SMART TV to the internet.','Issue: SMART TV unable to connect to the internet.\r\nFindings: Wi-Fi signal strength was weak at the TV’s location, causing intermittent or failed network connections.\r\nAction Taken: Temporarily connected the SMART TV to a Wi-Fi hotspot created from a laptop to ensure internet access. Will recommend installing a LAN connection to the TV for a stable and permanent network solution.\r\nStatus: Completed (Temporary Fix Applied).','10.40.0.10','2025-11-05 03:21:50','2025-11-05 05:52:43'),(1422,531,3,6,'Completed','Can\'t connect to Internet',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-06 00:06:36','2025-11-06 02:53:34'),(1423,10,3,2,'Completed','Insperction for turnover to Supply Unit','The unit remains operational; however, it has been observed to perform very slowly and frequently experiences system lag even during basic operations such as document processing and web browsing. Initial troubleshooting and basic maintenance procedures—including disk cleanup and removal of unnecessary files—were conducted, but these efforts did not significantly improve performance. Upon assessment, it was determined that the desktop unit is already an obsolete model, with outdated hardware components that can no longer efficiently support current software and system requirements.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-06 08:52:17','2025-11-07 00:52:27'),(1424,182,0,1,'Completed','Ip configuration reset.','Network access has been restored.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-07 00:07:19','2025-11-07 05:05:22'),(1425,120,3,1,'Completed','Request for technical assistance on the computer used for the Neuro Examination.','Actions taken: Logged in account to the captive portal for internet connection.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-07 01:08:27','2025-11-07 02:00:33'),(1426,188,3,1,'Completed','Could not connect to STAFFNET ssid.','Actions taken: Checked router configuration and rebooted device.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-07 02:17:54','2025-11-12 00:03:29'),(1427,126,0,4,'Completed','Installation of OBS and Adobe applications.','Successfully installed Adobe Creative Suite and OBS application.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-07 05:06:08','2025-11-07 06:54:02'),(1428,174,0,2,'Completed','Check laptop operation and battery performance and hdmi port.','Findings: The laptop operates very slowly, its battery no longer holds a charge requiring continuous connection to a power source, and the HDMI port frequently disconnects connected devices during use. Given its outdated hardware and unreliable components, continued use would hinder productivity and maintenance efficiency. Recommendation: It is recommended that the unit be replaced due to its declining performance and hardware issues. A replacement unit with updated specifications is advised to ensure smooth and reliable operation.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-07 05:40:35','2025-11-07 06:01:58'),(1429,90,4,6,'Completed','unable to contact the Quarter Deck Telephone',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-11 00:28:32','2025-11-13 06:30:19'),(1430,33,4,1,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-11 00:48:55','2025-11-11 01:48:45'),(1431,231,NULL,1,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-11 01:05:51','2025-11-11 01:32:23'),(1432,184,1,2,'Completed','The laptop has stopped working and recommended for repair.','Findings: Upon inspection, the Asus UX310U laptop is still working but was found to have aging hardware components, including an older-generation Intel processor and limited storage performance due to its standard HDD. Additionally, the battery is defective, as the laptop cannot power on or be used without being plugged into the charger. It was also observed that some keys on the keyboard register ghost touches, further affecting usability.\r\nRecommendation: Replacement of the entire laptop unit is recommended, as multiple hardware components (battery, keyboard, and storage drive) are already degraded. Repairs or upgrades would not be cost-effective, and replacing the unit will ensure reliability, improved performance, and productivity for office operations.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-11 01:49:18','2025-11-12 02:38:14'),(1433,200,4,4,'Completed','Installation of Kyocera Printer',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-11 02:26:35','2025-11-11 02:28:07'),(1434,104,1,6,'Cancelled','Unable to access the email account.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 00:21:24','2025-11-18 01:00:00'),(1435,168,4,3,'Completed','When printing, there is no color.','The Printhead is no longer serviceable and is recommended for disposal due to irreparable damage and deteriorated performance.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 00:24:45','2025-11-17 06:10:33'),(1436,195,4,3,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 01:01:36','2025-11-17 06:26:06'),(1437,37,4,5,'Completed','One-Time Evaluation of IT Equipment for turn-over to Supply Unit','The following unserviceable ICT equipment were inspected and found to be non-functional and beyond economical repair. All items are recommended for disposal.\r\n\r\nUPS\r\n\r\nAPC UPS (Temp Tag 2024-A-0179) – Internal short circuit.\r\n\r\nSecure UPS (S/N: 9B2211A24413) – Battery depleted and non-functional.\r\n\r\nAVR\r\n\r\nMitsui AVR (No Property Tag) – Internal short circuit.\r\n\r\nSecure AVR (ICS 2022-00685) – Internal short circuit.\r\n\r\nKEYBOARDS\r\n\r\nA4Tech Keyboard (ICS 2022-00659 / PAR-2016-030) – Damaged cable; intermittent connection.\r\n\r\nASUS Keyboard (ICS 2022-00665) – Unresponsive keys.\r\n\r\nSYSTEM UNITS\r\n\r\nTrendsonic System Unit (ICS 2024-PIC-0615) – Motherboard damaged beyond repair.\r\n\r\nSamsung System Unit (ICS 2024-A-0178) – Motherboard defective; non-functional.\r\n\r\nMONITOR\r\n\r\nAOC Monitor (ICS 2024-PIC-0613) – Defective; no display.\r\n\r\nAll listed items are recommended for proper disposal.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 01:43:27','2025-11-18 23:46:51'),(1438,97,1,4,'Completed','unable to login to email.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 02:51:36','2025-11-13 02:54:18'),(1439,221,0,6,'Completed','Cannot upload some files to Google Drive.','Findings: Google drive did not detect some power point files. Recommendations: Upload the files individually (instead of bulk upload) that Google Drive reports as missing files.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 06:32:59','2025-11-12 06:35:08'),(1440,10,4,6,'Completed','Inspection for turnover of unserviceable UPS to Supply Unit',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 07:55:22','2025-11-14 06:24:42'),(1441,10,3,4,'Completed','Installation of e-NGAs','Actions taken: Installed eNGAS app and configured config utility.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 07:56:37','2025-11-13 02:41:35'),(1442,46,3,3,'Completed','CANON G4010 cannot print documents','Actions taken: Forwarded the concern to the resident IT of CME for troubleshooting.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 08:19:37','2025-11-13 02:44:36'),(1443,130,3,6,'Completed','Installation of eNGAS','Actions taken: Installed eNGAS app and configured config utility.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 08:19:55','2025-11-13 02:41:52'),(1444,200,3,6,'Completed','Installation of eBUDGET','Actions taken: Installed eBUDGET app and configured config utility. Also installed VPN (Anyconnect).','10.40.0.10','2025-11-12 08:20:20','2025-11-13 02:42:37'),(1445,131,3,4,'Completed','ENGAS installation.','Actions taken: Installed eNGAS app and configured config utility.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-13 00:34:07','2025-11-13 02:41:13'),(1446,131,3,3,'Completed','Printer connectivity.','Actions taken: Installed printer driver and shared printer to 2 staff.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-13 00:35:17','2025-11-13 02:40:05'),(1447,9,1,2,'Completed','change date and time on the laptop.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-13 05:37:56','2025-11-13 08:37:25'),(1448,532,3,4,'Completed','Installation of internet to new device','Issue: The cadet was unable to connect to the cadets’ captive portal due to an incorrect password entry.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-13 06:14:44','2025-11-13 06:19:42'),(1449,533,3,6,'Completed','Cannot access to ms teams','Actions taken: Performed password reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 00:12:46','2025-11-14 00:16:43'),(1450,533,3,6,'Completed','Cannot access to ms teams','Actions taken: Performed password reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 00:12:48','2025-11-14 00:16:52'),(1451,127,5,6,'Completed','Request for access  to the NAS shared folder.','Action Taken: \n>Create new shared folder in AD\n>Restricted only to PAMRU personnel\n>Deploy to enduser\n>1TB storage','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 00:17:24','2025-11-14 02:01:35'),(1452,127,5,6,'Completed','Request for access  to the NAS shared folder.','Disregard this ticket','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 00:17:26','2025-11-14 02:01:51'),(1453,148,3,3,'Completed','Printer not working','Findings: The printer’s date and time need to be configured.\n\nActions: Set the printers time.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 03:57:18','2025-11-14 07:01:46'),(1454,148,3,5,'Completed','Desktop for updating','Actions taken: Installed SSD, installed OS, installed standard softwares, installed windows updates, installed utility drivers, restored office files.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 04:00:35','2025-12-03 07:02:53'),(1455,534,3,6,'Completed','Cannot open my account','Actions taken: Performed password reset.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 06:27:46','2025-11-14 06:32:40'),(1456,535,1,6,'Completed','Trouble signing in',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 06:36:22','2025-11-14 06:41:58'),(1457,142,0,1,'Completed','No internet connection.','Connected the device to STAFFNET. Internet connection successfully restored.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 07:51:10','2025-11-14 07:51:49'),(1458,147,3,5,'Completed',NULL,'Actions taken: Installed new computer (mini PC), and transferred old pc on the front desk.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 08:56:51','2025-11-14 08:58:23'),(1459,55,0,2,'Completed','Cannot login to new Dell laptop.','Findings: The account\'s initial log-in is being done outside the PMMA\'s domains coverage. Action Taken: Connected the admin account first to PMMA VPN then log-in the account as other user. Account creation and connection successfully established.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-14 11:52:03','2025-11-14 12:10:52'),(1460,227,4,6,'Completed','Register the new assigned janitorial staff in biometrics.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 00:52:03','2025-11-17 23:59:47'),(1461,147,1,4,'Completed','cannot access Microsoft word etc. needs a product key','Issue: Unable to access Microsoft Word and other Office applications; system prompts for product key.\r\nFindings: Office was not activated because the logged-in account did not have an assigned Microsoft 365 license, causing the applications to require a product key.\r\nAction Taken: Assigned the appropriate Microsoft 365 license and activated Office using the authorized account. Verified that Microsoft Word and other Office applications are now fully accessible.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 00:59:40','2025-11-17 03:57:34'),(1462,90,1,3,'Completed','cant print in black','Findings: Printer unable to produce black ink output during printing.\r\nAction Taken:Conducted power cleaning / deep cleaning when standard cleaning was insufficient.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 01:04:25','2025-11-18 01:51:00'),(1463,188,1,1,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 01:10:19','2025-11-17 03:05:23'),(1464,77,5,5,'Completed','the unit takes a lot of time to run, open','Upgrade from HDD to SSD.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 01:11:51','2025-11-25 00:43:52'),(1465,34,1,4,'Completed','Installation of the Landbank application.','Issue: User requested installation of the Landbank application.\r\nFindings: Installation required elevated system privileges, which the standard user account did not have.\r\nAction Taken: Temporarily granted administrator privileges to the user account to allow installation.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 01:13:23','2025-11-17 04:04:25'),(1466,233,1,6,'Completed','update sims',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 01:37:03','2025-11-17 03:00:16'),(1467,231,0,6,'Completed','To give access to the account of Ms. Parangat to transfer files.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 01:39:35','2025-11-17 06:25:49'),(1468,215,4,4,'Completed','Help install account for new hired staff in DRDE.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 02:03:10','2025-11-17 06:24:59'),(1469,532,1,6,'Completed','Invalid password for teams account',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 05:00:10','2025-11-17 05:11:06'),(1470,13,4,3,'Completed','Installed the Kyocera printer on the laptop and installed the cable molding.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 05:12:04','2025-11-17 06:02:44'),(1471,147,1,4,'Completed','epson software is not installed in new PC','Issue: Driver is installed, but scanning does not work using Epson Scan 2.\r\nFindings: Epson Scan 2 could not detect the scanner due to incomplete scanner components and incorrect configuration within the Epson Scan 2 utility.\r\nAction Taken: Reinstalled the complete Epson driver package (printer + scanner), reconfigured Epson Scan 2 to the correct connection type, and restarted the device. Scanner detection was restored, and Epson Scan 2 is now functioning properly.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 05:16:36','2025-11-17 06:38:22'),(1472,198,3,1,'Completed','Cannot connect to internet','Actions taken: Connected 2 laptops to the Personnel SSID; installed printer driver (kyocera) and connected laptop to the machine.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 05:21:20','2025-11-17 06:17:58'),(1473,541,3,1,'Completed',NULL,'Actions taken: Added account to Radius Server.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 05:29:51','2025-11-17 06:27:11'),(1474,285,1,5,'Completed','I cannot access teams',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-17 06:01:24','2025-11-17 08:17:55'),(1475,531,3,6,'Completed','Wifi blocked','Actions taken: A