ded that these be replaced with new UPS units to ensure continuous and reliable power protection for office equipment.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-19 03:28:45','2025-11-19 06:51:58'),(1495,90,3,1,'Completed','2/O Martinez cant access wifi','Findings: The user is unable to log in due to entering an incorrect password.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-19 03:44:04','2025-11-20 05:44:16'),(1496,142,0,6,'Completed','Multi-factor authenticator is active. Cannot log-in my PMMA account and dental account.','Disabled multi-factor authenticator of ri.pagsolingan@pmma.edu.ph and dental@pmma.edu.ph','10.40.0.10','2025-11-19 05:44:23','2025-11-19 05:45:20'),(1497,106,3,1,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: Slow internet connection.\n\nActions taken: transferred the USB dongle to a USB port at the back of the computer.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-19 05:57:57','2025-11-19 08:34:57'),(1498,10,3,4,'Completed','Unable to modify the titles/names and enter decimal amounts in eNGAS.','Upon verification, the issue has already been resolved.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-19 08:01:07','2025-11-27 03:52:56'),(1499,9,0,3,'Completed','Setup of new printer. Epson L5290.','Successfully initialized ink charge and installed the driver to users laptop.','10.40.0.10','2025-11-19 08:52:49','2025-11-19 08:53:31'),(1500,545,5,6,'Completed','MS TEAMS',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-20 00:16:42','2025-11-20 00:30:26'),(1501,16,4,2,'Completed','Upon entering login credentials, the laptop screen goes black.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-11-20 00:31:55','2025-11-20 02:54:22'),(1502,375,1,6,'Completed','REGISTRATION FOR CANVA','Sent the Canva invitation link to your Outlook email..','10.40.0.10','2025-11-20 00:39:46','2025-11-24 08:25:16'),(1503,546,1,6,'Completed','Upgrade to canv pro','Sent the Canva invitation link to your Outlook email..','10.40.0.10','2025-11-20 00:43:39','2025-11-24 08:23:32'),(1504,546,1,6,'Completed','Upgrade to canv pro','Sent the Canva invitation link to your Outlook email..','10.40.0.10','2025-11-20 00:43:41','2025-11-24 0