\n\nActions taken: Reinstalled the eNGAS app.','10.40.0.10','2025-12-01 03:51:40','2025-12-01 05:25:42'),(1577,233,3,6,'Completed','update sims thank you','Actions taken: Downloaded biometrics logs and performed update on SIMS.','10.40.0.10','2025-12-01 03:55:24','2025-12-01 05:51:59'),(1578,195,3,3,'Completed','unable to print','Findings: The printer’s paper feed mechanism is malfunctioning; during print operations, the paper fails to advance and is not transported through the output tray. Actions taken: Inspected the cause of the paper feed issue and discovered that a staple wire was obstructing the paper path. The staple was removed to clear the blockage.','10.40.0.10','2025-12-01 05:45:19','2025-12-01 06:43:02'),(1579,167,NULL,3,'Cancelled','Printer needs PMS',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-12-01 06:22:50','2025-12-01 06:30:24'),(1580,90,3,3,'Completed','printer of the DMA Sec is not working','Findings: Could not print due to paper mismatch.\n\nActions taken: Applied the proper media type and paper size parameters in the printer’s configuration settings.','10.40.0.10','2025-12-01 07:44:58','2025-12-02 01:23:44'),(1581,549,1,6,'Completed','Unable to log in my account in MS TEAMS',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-12-02 00:11:53','2025-12-02 00:18:37'),(1582,241,1,6,'Completed','trouble signing in with microsoft teams pmma account',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2025-12-02 00:12:28','2025-12-02 00:20:51'),(1583,187,0,4,'Completed','Sims not showing dtr print out.','Pinged the sims server to re-initialize connection. DTR print out is now showing.','10.40.0.10','2025-12-02 00:44:29','2025-12-02 01:26:31'),(1584,120,0,2,'Completed','Cannot log in to Dell brand new laptop.','Connected the admin account to Personnel-WiFi and re-established domain connection. User account can now connect to PMMA domain and user account log-in successfull.','10.40.0.10','2025-12-02 00:45:12','2025-12-02 01:28:04'),(1585,538,3,6,'Completed','To setup printer for wireless direct printing.','Actions taken: Configured t