efective RAM; only one RAM module is currently in use while awaiting replacement parts.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-06 05:27:44','2026-01-07 03:37:56'),(1674,151,3,3,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: The ink pad needs service.\n\nActions taken: Performed maintenance (waste ink pad counter reset).','10.40.0.10','2026-01-07 01:24:01','2026-01-07 07:21:22'),(1675,35,3,2,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: Busted switching power supply, and the SSD failed to load the operating system. \n\nActions taken: Replaced the defective power supply. Recovered the files in the SSD and formatted the SSD, installed OS, installed standard softwares, installed utility drivers and windows updates.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-07 03:49:08','2026-01-08 07:02:16'),(1676,208,3,3,'Completed',NULL,'Findings:When printing, the paper gets wrinkled/creased.\n\nActions taken: Troubleshooting was performed and found that a piece of plastic is blocking the paper path. (Removed the obstruction)','10.40.0.10','2026-01-07 06:05:40','2026-01-15 00:24:33'),(1677,153,3,6,'Completed','Unable to access Mess shared folder.','Findings: Unable to access the shared folder due to a network connectivity issue.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-08 06:57:05','2026-01-08 07:04:24'),(1678,231,NULL,6,'Completed','Request to fix MS Account.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 00:56:30','2026-01-15 00:50:10'),(1679,231,NULL,6,'Completed','Request to fix MS Account.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 00:56:34','2026-01-15 00:50:18'),(1680,215,4,2,'Completed','Troubleshoot and check for system function.','After inspection, it was found that the laptop motherboard is not functioning. The device does not power on and diagnostic tests confirm motherboard failure. Repair or replacement is not economically feasible. The laptop is beyond repair and is recommended for disposal','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 01:04:51','2026-01-15 02:28:46'),(1681,380,1,1,'Completed','Cannot access eduroam',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 01:39:17','2026-01-13 00:09:55'),(1682,233,1,6,'Completed','Update SIMS',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 02:40:58','2026-01-12 07:46:38'),(1683,121,1,3,'Completed','unable to connect to any printer','Findings: Print Spooler service was stopped, preventing all print jobs from processing.\r\nAction Taken: Restarted the Print Spooler service and verified printer availability. Printing functionality restored.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 02:41:47','2026-01-12 06:00:52'),(1684,208,3,3,'Completed','unable to print','Findings:When printing, the paper gets wrinkled/creased.\n\nActions taken: Troubleshooting was performed and found that a piece of plastic is blocking the paper path. (Removed the obstruction)','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 02:42:11','2026-01-15 00:24:43'),(1685,46,1,3,'Completed','Canon printer always displays “Paper Jam” error even when no paper is present.','Findings: No jammed paper found in the paper feed path; error persists despite empty tray.\r\nAction Taken: Inspected and cleaned the paper feed area and rollers; checked paper sensors and reset the printer.\r\nRecommendation: If the issue persists, possible faulty paper sensor—recommend further repair or replacement.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 04:20:44','2026-01-12 04:21:08'),(1686,46,1,3,'Completed','Epson L5290 displays “Ink Pad Counter Maxed Out” / Service Required error.','Findings: The internal waste ink pad counter has reached its maximum limit, preventing normal printer operation.\r\nAction Taken: Performed ink pad counter reset using the appropriate service utility and verified printer functionality.\r\nRecommendation: Regular monitoring advised; consider physical waste ink pad replacement for long-term use.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 04:30:38','2026-01-12 04:31:10'),(1687,564,5,6,'Completed','validex password','Password Reset','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 05:29:52','2026-01-12 05:31:48'),(1688,29,1,3,'Completed','Printer installation','Findings: Printer was not installed and required drivers were missing.\r\nAction Taken: Connected the printer to the laptop and installed the required printer drivers. Printer functionality verified through successful test print.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 05:47:03','2026-01-12 08:09:54'),(1689,167,1,3,'Completed','Can\'t print. Printer is in offline status even the it is already turned on','Findings: Printer was powered on but unable to acquire an IP address, causing it to remain in offline status.\r\nAction Taken: Checked network connection and printer network settings, reconfigured the network connection, and successfully assigned an IP address. Printer status returned online and printing was restored.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 06:04:27','2026-01-12 08:11:29'),(1690,29,1,3,'Completed','Connect the Printer to the Laptop.','Findings: Printer was not installed and required drivers were missing.\r\nAction Taken: Connected the printer to the laptop and installed the required printer drivers. Printer functionality verified through successful test print.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 06:11:50','2026-01-12 08:09:29'),(1691,553,0,6,'Completed','My validex account is not working in the website, it cant login sir','Reset validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-12 07:19:41','2026-01-15 00:12:39'),(1692,150,3,6,'Completed','To add user to the address book of Kyocera printer for scanning.','Actions taken: Added two (2) users to the Kyocera address book for network scanning (Ms. Danna and Ms. Ellen).','10.40.0.10','2026-01-13 00:20:34','2026-01-13 02:25:37'),(1693,565,1,6,'Completed','having trouble of signing in ms teams account','Findings: User account was blocked from signing in, preventing access to Microsoft Teams.\r\nAction Taken: Verified account status, unblocked the user account, and confirmed successful sign-in to Microsoft Teams.','10.40.0.10','2026-01-13 00:25:48','2026-01-13 00:28:31'),(1694,29,4,1,'Completed','WEAK INTERNET CONNECTION',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-01-13 00:46:13','2026-01-13 01:55:34'),(1695,566,0,6,'Completed','No account in validex website.','Created account for 13744@cdt.pmm