 the network server, preventing access to the Staff Net.\r\nAction Taken: Registered the device’s MAC address on the server and verified successful connection to the Staff Network.\r\nStatus: Resolved','10.40.0.10','2026-01-29 01:37:03','2026-02-03 03:28:53'),(1797,233,1,6,'Completed','Update SIMS. Thank you po',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-01-29 01:48:41','2026-01-29 08:28:22'),(1798,10,1,6,'Completed','cannot open my outlook','Issue: Unable to open Microsoft Outlook\r\nFindings: The issue was caused by a Microsoft license problem, preventing Outlook from opening properly.\r\nAction Taken: Verified the user’s account and reassigned the appropriate Microsoft license. Reactivated Office applications and confirmed that Outlook is now accessible.\r\nStatus: Resolved','10.40.0.10','2026-01-29 03:38:25','2026-02-03 03:25:30'),(1799,14,1,6,'Completed','CREATION OF SHARED FOLDER FOR PO (WITH ACCESS TO BAC AND SPMU). Details are indicated in the email.','Action Taken: Created a shared folder for PO documents and configured access permissions for BAC and SPMU users.\r\nStatus: Completed / Access granted','10.40.0.10','2026-01-29 05:18:38','2026-02-02 03:17:47'),(1800,3,5,6,'Completed','eNGAS password and username reset','Forgot Password\nAction Taken: Reset password.\n\nNew password: peVNEx','10.40.0.10','2026-02-02 00:16:38','2026-02-03 01:32:33'),(1801,233,1,6,'Completed','update sims. thank you po',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-02-02 01:07:07','2026-02-02 02:58:18'),(1802,120,4,1,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-02-02 05:04:09','2026-02-02 05:04:16'),(1803,33,4,1,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-02-02 05:04:49','2026-02-02 05:04:54'),(1804,60,0,2,'Completed','Conduct a check-up of my laptop before returning it to Supply and Property Management Unit.','The laptop is fully functional and operating properly. Its charger has been replaced with a brand-new compatible unit.','10.40.0.10','2026-02-03 01:00:03','2026-02-03 01:08:25'),(1805,16,NULL,2,'Cancelled','No password sign-in option on the screen.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-02-03 01:52:34','2026-02-03 03:31:18'),(1806,14,3,6,'Completed','Unable to access the shared folder.','Actions taken: Mapped shared folder to the users computer.','10.40.0.10','2026-02-03 01:54:00','2026-02-03 03:40:28'),(1807,125,1,3,'Completed','EPSON printer shows notification that \"Maintenance box is nearing the end of its service life\" and needs replacement.','Issue: Epson printer displays notification: “Maintenance box is nearing the end of its service life” and can no longer print.\r\nFindings: The printer’s maintenance box has reached its maximum capacity, automatically disabling printing to prevent ink overflow.\r\nAction Taken: Verified printer status and confirmed that printing is disabled due to a full maintenance box. User was informed of the cause and required replacement.\r\nRecommendation: Replace the Epson Maintenance Box (Model: T04D1) to restore normal printing operations.','10.40.0.10','2026-02-03 02:28:01','2026-02-04 06:48:56'),(1808,199,3,2,'Completed',NULL,'Findings: The computer becomes unresponsive when it is bumped against the user’s knee.\n\nActions taken: The system unit was moved to a location where it cannot be bumped by the user’s knee.','10.40.0.10','2026-02-03 05:11:50','2026-02-03 05:34:49'),(1809,9,3,6,'Completed','Request access to the shared folder (Purchase Request).','Actions taken: Mapped shared folder to the users computer.','10.40.0.10','2026-02-03 05:14:08','2026-02-03 05:30:33'),(1810,200,3,6,'Completed','One of the modules in eBudget is experiencing an error.','Actions taken: Checked user access roles in the ebudget security module app. (added users info: plantilla and employee number).','10.40.0.10','2026-02-03 08:02:17','2026-02-04 00:13:37'),(1811,6,3,1,'Completed','unable to join the network \"PMMA_STAFFNET\"','Actions taken: Verified the MAC address and disabled MAC address randomization.','10.40.0.10','2026-02-04 01:47:54','2026-02-04 03:31:48'),(1812,62,4,3,