leted','Scanner not working.','The printer connection was intermittent, causing the scanner to be undetected by the system. Configured the printing and scanning functions to operate via a wireless connection instead.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-02 00:29:14','2026-06-02 01:55:28'),(2371,410,0,6,'Completed','can\'t open Validex account. Forgot the email and address.','Successfully reset the Validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-02 00:35:40','2026-06-02 00:39:05'),(2372,167,3,3,'Completed','Printer delayed response in printing even in plain paper and standard quality. And also, UPS unable to back up power supply','Changed the printer configuration from wireless to wired network connectivity and installed a new UPS.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-02 02:32:57','2026-06-03 05:25:22'),(2373,208,0,4,'Completed','Cannot log in to MS 365 applications.','Connected the PC to the domain and relogged in the user\'s account. Successfully logged in to MS 365 account.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-02 06:46:26','2026-06-02 07:51:22'),(2374,320,NULL,1,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-02 06:53:26','2026-06-15 00:00:08'),(2375,152,0,1,'Completed','Sudden disconnection to the mess shared folder.','Reconnected the network connection thru PMMA captive portal. Connection to the shared folder was successfully re-established.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-02 07:00:44','2026-06-02 07:15:51'),(2376,723,0,2,'Completed','Laptop is not charging and booting.','The charging port module is possibly broken. Tried the USB-C bypass charging port and successfully charged and booted the laptop.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-02 08:30:58','2026-06-02 08:33:26'),(2377,195,3,1,'Completed','Internet connection remains unavailable even after portal login.','Performed system reboot.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-03 00:28:43','2026-06-03 00:47:19'),(2378,195,3,1,'Completed','Internet connection remains unavailable even after portal login.','Performed system reboot.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-03 00:28:45','2026-06-03 00:47:32'),(2379,75,0,2,'Completed','The laptop fell from the teacher’s table while it was charging. The charging cord was accidentally pulled, causing the laptop to fall and resulting in damage to one of its parts. Since the incident, the laptop has no longer been able to power on or open. It is recommended that the unit be checked by the ITSU to determine the cause of the issue and assess the extent of the damage.','Findings: Upon inspection and troubleshooting, it was determined that the laptop sustained significant physical damage, including a dislocated and damaged right hinge, broken casing components, and monitor misalignment. The impact from the incident likely caused damage to one or more internal hardware components, resulting in the unit\'s inability to power on. Basic troubleshooting procedures were performed; however, the issue persists. Based on the assessment, the laptop has sustained extensive hardware damage and is currently non-operational.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-03 05:24:07','2026-06-03 05:32:47'),(2380,167,3,6,'Completed','The LED TV is powered on but shows no display.','Upon checking, the issue appears to be caused by defective LED backlight strips or a faulty backlight driver circuit. It is recommended that the unit be referred for repair and further technical evaluation.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-03 05:27:58','2026-06-08 00:24:09'),(2381,20,3,3,'Completed','Unable to Scan documents','Set up the printer to support wireless printing and scanning as a workaround for the faulty USB cable connection.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-03 06:42:40','2026-06-08 02:57:40'),(2382,149,3,6,'Completed','Can\'t connect rd.pampolino@pmma.edu.ph to outlook.','Verified microsoft license.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-03 23:16:42','2026-06-04 01:15:05'),(2383,724,NULL,1,'Completed','Trouble connecting to network',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-04 00:22:38','2026-06-15 00:00:20'),(2384,233,3,6,'Completed','update po sims. thank you po','Downloaded biometrics logs and updated SIMS.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-04 05:22:43','2026-06-04 08:41:28'),(2385,75,3,3,'Completed','Request to install printer driver (Brother) to laptop.','Installed printer driver.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-04 05:50:57','2026-06-04 08:43:17'),(2386,229,3,3,'Completed','Printer connection (request since 1344H)','Unable to respond immediately due to ongoing support activities and limited personnel availability, as I am currently the only staff member attending support calls. Upon checking at the requestor\'s office, the reported issue had already been resolved.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-04 06:49:33','2026-06-04 08:49:42'),(2387,13,3,6,'Completed','Unable to scan in Kyocera printer.','Temporarily connected the printer via USB and installed Kyocera Quick Scan. However, the application was not functional due to compatibility issues. A new network configuration will be set up to enable printer accessibility over the network.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-04 08:40:06','2026-06-04 08:59:40'),(2388,119,3,6,'Completed','PSIPOP error.','The webpage had expired. Added the site to the Internet Explorer Mode pages list to ensure compatibility. Also connected the computer to the shared printers.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-04 08:40:34','2026-06-04 08:54:39'),(2389,537,3,3,'Completed','The printer is experiencing a technical malfunction','Investigated the printing issue and found that print jobs were being interrupted, causing the printer to eject the paper before completing the printout. Further troubleshooting revealed that the source file was missing from its designated location, which contributed to the printing problem.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 01:17:53','2026-06-10 03:09:32'),(2390,653,3,6,'Completed','Request for inspection of laptop and endorsement to the Supply Unit for safekeeping and proper custody.','Conducted a technical assessment of the laptop and confirmed that the unit is functioning properly and operating within normal parameters.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 02:45:44','2026-06-08 03:00:59'),(2391,131,3,1,'Completed','No internet connection.','Logged in user account in the captive portal.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 02:46:43','2026-06-08 02:54:56'),(2392,653,3,6,'Completed','Request to connect the desktop computer to the LAN and internet network in the Dean\'s Office.','Installed and terminated an RJ45 modular connector, then connected the desktop computer to the Local Area Network (LAN).','10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 02:48:01','2026-06-18 06:42:20'),(2393,90,5,6,'Completed','Request for a premium Canva account','# Canva Pro Registration Guide\n\nYour request for **Canva Pro** access has been approved. An invitation has been sent to your **official PMMA email address**.\n\n### How to Register\n\n1. Log in to your **PMMA official email account**.\n2. Open the email invitation from **Canva**.\n3. Click the **Accept Invitation** or **Join Team** button.\n4. Sign in using your **PMMA official email address**.\n\n   * If you do not have a Canva account yet, select **Sign Up** and create one using your PMMA email.\n5. Complete the registration process and accept the invitation.\n6. Once completed, you will have access to **Canva Pro** under the PMMA team.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n* Please use **only your PMMA official email address** to activate your Canva Pro account.\n* If you cannot find the invitation, check your **Spam/Junk** folder.\n* If you experience any issues or have not received the invitation, please submit an ICT support request at **https://support.pmma.edu.ph/**.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 05:20:19','2026-06-29 07:00:42'),(2394,150,3,1,'Completed','Local Area Network (LAN) connection is unavailable at the Procurement Head Office.','Performed re-crimping of the RJ45 connector to correct cable termination issues.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 05:42:34','2026-06-08 06:27:09'),(2395,516,NULL,6,'Cancelled','validex',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 05:46:01','2026-06-10 00:30:54'),(2396,516,NULL,6,'Cancelled','validex',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 05:46:02','2026-06-10 00:30:30'),(2397,98,3,2,'Completed','The computer experiences frequent system hangs and exhibits slow response times during operation.','Performed troubleshooting and determined that the computer frequently hangs during operation, affecting user productivity. It is recommended to upgrade the existing HDD to an SSD to improve system performance, reduce loading times, and enhance overall responsiveness.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-08 08:00:59','2026-06-08 08:09:21'),(2398,6,3,3,'Completed','Poor color quality (printing green tint instead of black/gray), tried deep cleaning but did not resolve the issue.','Performed printer maintenance; however, the issue persists. The problem may be related to the recently refilled black ink. Advised the user to continue using the printer until the current ink supply is consumed, then refill it again and monitor whether the issue is resolved.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-09 01:47:51','2026-06-09 08:23:51'),(2399,156,3,1,'Completed','No internet connectivity at Safety Center','Upon verification, the network connection had already been restored and was functioning normally.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-09 02:44:51','2026-06-10 05:34:37'),(2400,131,3,1,'Completed','Intemittent wireless connection. (Weak Signal)','Upon inspection, the uplink connection from the HR Office was found to be down. Reconnected the uplink cable to the appropriate network port, restoring connectivity.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-09 02:45:30','2026-06-09 06:44:26'),(2401,27,3,6,'Completed','Could not login account in laptop?','Upon inspection, the account was successfully accessed. Further verification revealed that the user had previously requested an email address update but was attempting to log in using the old email address instead of the updated one.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-09 02:46:40','2026-06-09 06:47:24'),(2402,16,3,6,'Completed','Request for telephone line relocation and LAN connection of the network printer.','Installed and terminated a UTP cable for the transfer of the VoIP phone and network printer to their new location.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-09 02:48:21','2026-06-16 07:26:09'),(2403,31,3,1,'Completed',NULL,'Upon inspection the connection was already restored.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-09 03:16:43','2026-06-09 06:48:00'),(2404,175,5,4,'Completed','Foxit license for all Planning personnel','Action Taken:\nDeploy in AD\nInstall Foxit Editor application for the computers of the following users:\nMs. Quinsay\nMs. Martirez\nMr. Apino\nMr. Dorde\nMr. Cudal','10.40.0.10','2026-06-09 03:36:25','2026-06-22 03:50:03'),(2405,98,3,6,'Completed','Request to backup Engr. Ong\'s.','Backed up files from the old user accounts and reformatted the drive for use as a storage device for office files.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 00:12:09','2026-06-10 03:05:37'),(2406,725,0,6,'Completed','Cannot access validex','Successfully reset the Validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 00:24:03','2026-06-10 00:25:09'),(2407,168,4,3,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 00:41:36','2026-06-10 00:41:42'),(2408,726,0,6,'Completed','Cannot access my validex account.','Successfully reset the Validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 02:01:20','2026-06-10 02:02:09'),(2409,609,0,6,'Completed','Cannot generate OTP code for MS 365 Accounts.','Successfully disabled the two-factor authenticator of MS 365 accounts.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 02:54:05','2026-06-10 03:00:27'),(2410,139,0,6,'Completed','Contact Information - Email: cb.andrada@pmmaeduph.onmicrosoft.com instead of cb.andrada@pmma.edu.ph','The email address cb.andrada@pmma.edu.ph is now receiving incoming emails.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 03:01:55','2026-06-10 05:36:57'),(2411,632,0,6,'Completed','Cannot access my Validex account.','Successfully reset the Validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 03:12:08','2026-06-10 03:13:35'),(2412,130,3,1,'Completed','Intermittent connection.','Performed troubleshooting and determined that the wireless router was malfunctioning. As a temporary solution, the router was replaced with an outdoor access point (AP) to restore internet connectivity.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-10 05:29:30','2026-06-10 05:33:41'),(2413,78,4,4,'Completed','Need administrator password to install the software.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-11 01:27:34','2026-06-18 00:39:31'),(2414,78,NULL,4,'Cancelled','Installation of wifi dongle driver and MS Office apps to CMT PC.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-11 02:11:02','2026-06-15 00:58:48'),(2415,78,NULL,4,'Cancelled','Installation of wifi dongle driver and MS Office apps to CMT PC.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-11 02:11:04','2026-06-15 00:58:39'),(2416,29,3,1,'Completed','unstable connection',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-11 03:02:53','2026-06-15 06:37:58'),(2417,709,0,6,'Completed','I want my validex acct to be reset because I forgot the password','Successfully reset the Validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-13 00:05:14','2026-06-15 03:19:59'),(2418,233,3,6,'Completed','update sims po. thank you','Downloaded biometricslogs and updated SIMS.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-15 01:42:35','2026-06-15 08:36:36'),(2419,185,4,2,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-15 01:55:02','2026-06-15 01:55:11'),(2420,185,4,2,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-15 01:55:03','2026-06-15 01:55:21'),(2421,556,0,6,'Completed','Cannot log-in to the validex website.','Successfully reset the Validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-15 02:58:35','2026-06-15 03:19:02'),(2422,358,0,6,'Completed','Cannot log-in my validex account.','Successfully reset the Validex account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-15 05:04:07','2026-06-15 05:04:46'),(2423,25,3,6,'Completed','Request to connect mobile phone to the internet.','Registered the device\'s MAC address in the _STAFFNET allowlist to enable network access.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-15 07:23:11','2026-06-16 02:29:10'),(2424,153,3,6,'Completed','VOIP is not working.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-15 08:53:47','2026-06-16 07:57:16'),(2425,187,3,1,'Completed','unable to connect to any WIFI',