pection report for the Kyocera printer assigned to DRDE.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-18 05:54:59','2026-06-22 00:55:06'),(2442,104,3,1,'Completed','Request to connect mobile phone to the internet.','Registered device to the staffnet ssid allowed list.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-22 00:51:49','2026-06-22 03:30:21'),(2443,15,3,1,'Completed','Could not connect laptop to the internet.','Performed system reboot and connected laptop to the internet.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-22 00:52:38','2026-06-22 03:22:26'),(2444,728,3,3,'Completed','PMMA steering committee printer not turning on','performed troubleshooting and seems the power adaptor of the printer is defective. It is recommended to replace the power adapter to restore normal printer operation.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-22 01:04:10','2026-06-29 08:40:01'),(2445,168,3,3,'Completed','Unable access the printer','Upon inspection, the printer was unable to print due to multiple pending print jobs stuck in the print spooler queue. Cleared and cancelled all pending print jobs, restoring normal printing functionality.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-22 01:05:07','2026-06-22 03:25:18'),(2446,171,3,6,'Completed','Request to connect solar inverter at CMT to the internet.','Patched the solar inverter\'s network cable to the network switch to provide internet connectivity and enable remote access.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-22 02:24:54','2026-06-22 03:27:14'),(2447,33,3,6,'Completed','Request for technical assistance in troubleshooting the webcam and audio devices, which are not functioning during the ongoing webinar.','Verified that the webcam and microphone were working normally; they only needed to be enabled.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-22 02:27:51','2026-06-22 03:29:21'),(2448,491,3,3,'Completed','printer is printing green instead of black','Performed printer maintenance (head cleaning, printhead alignment, inkflush).','10.40.0.10','2026-06-22 03:35:25','2026-06-22 07:02:14'),(2449,153,3,6,'Completed','VOIP is not working','Repatched utp cable to the LAN port