.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-25 00:11:51','2026-06-25 01:03:18'),(2458,616,0,6,'Completed','The Outlook account is not receiving messages from all employees\' channels.','Successfully included the email account in the All PMMA Employees channel.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-25 01:02:48','2026-06-25 01:18:08'),(2459,105,3,6,'Completed','Request for the exchange of monitors currently assigned to Dr. Paraggua and the former Research Assistant on Monday, June 29.','Exchanged the monitors assigned to Dr. Paraggua and the Research Assistant.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-25 01:07:32','2026-06-29 02:33:11'),(2460,102,3,1,'Completed','Request to connect tablet to the internet.','Registered device to the staffnet ssid allowed list.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 02:33:53','2026-06-29 02:37:33'),(2461,181,0,6,'Completed','Reset the Outlook account password.','Successfully reset the Outlook account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 02:48:21','2026-06-29 02:49:47'),(2462,90,3,3,'Completed','my laptop cant detect the printer','Upon inspection, pending Windows updates were identified. Downloaded and installed the required updates, then restarted the system to complete the installation. After the restart, printing functionality was tested and confirmed to be operating normally.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 03:44:06','2026-06-29 08:37:13'),(2463,147,5,6,'Completed','Canva prp and foxit premium account request. For annototating pdf files and canva pro for posters/presentation regarding medical activities','# Canva Pro Registration Guide\n\nYour request for **Canva Pro** access has been approved. An invitation has been sent to your **official PMMA email address**.\n\n### How to Register\n\n1. Log in to your **PMMA official email account**.\n2. Open the email invitation from **Canva**.\n3. Click the **Accept Invitation** or **Join Team** button.\n4. Sign in using your **PMMA official email address**.\n\n   * If you do not have a Canva account yet, select **Sign Up** and create one using your PMMA email.\n5. Complete the registration process and accept the invitation.\n6. Once completed, you will have access to **Canva Pro** under the PMMA team.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n* Please use **only your PMMA official email address** to activate your Canva Pro account.\n* If you cannot find the invitation, check your **Spam/Junk** folder.\n* If you experience any issues or have not received the invitation, please submit an ICT support request at **https://support.pmma.edu.ph/**.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 04:19:46','2026-06-29 07:03:26'),(2464,166,5,4,'Completed','In connection with the email received regarding the availability of free premium applications (Canva and Foxit PDF Editor), I would like to respectfully request access to both Canva Pro and Foxit PDF Editor Premium. As the personnel responsible for the preparation of Board meeting materials which includes PowerPoint presentations for regular, special, and Finance Committee meetings, as well as other special committee sessions, I require reliable and efficient tools that will enable me to perform these tasks in a more professional and streamlined manner. In addition, access to Foxit PDF Editor Premium is essential for handling documents that need to be completed on behalf of the Superintendent and the members of the Board, ensuring accuracy and efficiency in document processing. Both applications are essentials in supporting my duties and will greatly enhance my productivity and the quality of my work. Thank you!','# Canva Pro Registration Guide\n\nYour request for **Canva Pro** access has been approved. An invitation has been sent to your **official PMMA email address**.\n\n### How to Register\n\n1. Log in to your **PMMA official email account**.\n2. Open the email invitation from **Canva**.\n3. Click the **Accept Invitation** or **Join Team** button.\n4. Sign in using your **PMMA official email address**.\n\n   * If you do not have a Canva account yet, select **Sign Up** and create one using your PMMA email.\n5. Complete the registration process and accept the invitation.\n6. Once completed, you will have access to **Canva Pro** under the PMMA team.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n* Please use **only your PMMA official email address** to activate your Canva Pro account.\n* If you cannot find the invitation, check your **Spam/Junk** folder.\n* If you experience any issues or have not received the invitation, please submit an ICT support request at **https://support.pmma.edu.ph/**.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 04:25:37','2026-06-29 07:02:39'),(2465,39,5,4,'Completed','Request for Canva Pro App. This will be used to create presentations for subjects I handle. Thank you','Your request for Canva Pro access has been approved. An invitation has been sent to your official PMMA email address.\n\nHow to Register\nLog in to your PMMA official email account.\nOpen the email invitation from Canva.\nClick the Accept Invitation or Join Team button.\nSign in using your PMMA official email address.\nIf you do not have a Canva account yet, select Sign Up and create one using your PMMA email.\nComplete the registration process and accept the invitation.\nOnce completed, you will have access to Canva Pro under the PMMA team.\n\nImportant Notes:\n\nPlease use only your PMMA official email address to activate your Canva Pro account.\nIf you cannot find the invitation, check your Spam/Junk folder.\nIf you experience any issues or have not received the invitation, please submit an ICT support request at https://support.pmma.edu.ph/.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 04:49:23','2026-06-29 06:59:36'),(2466,39,5,4,'Completed','Request for Canva Pro App. This will be used to create presentations for subjects I handle. Thank you','# Canva Pro Registration Guide\n\nYour request for **Canva Pro** access has been approved. An invitation has been sent to your **official PMMA email address**.\n\n### How to Register\n\n1. Log in to your **PMMA official email account**.\n2. Open the email invitation from **Canva**.\n3. Click the **Accept Invitation** or **Join Team** button.\n4. Sign in using your **PMMA official email address**.\n\n   * If you do not have a Canva account yet, select **Sign Up** and create one using your PMMA email.\n5. Complete the registration process and accept the invitation.\n6. Once completed, you will have access to **Canva Pro** under the PMMA team.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n* Please use **only your PMMA official email address** to activate your Canva Pro account.\n* If you cannot find the invitation, check your **Spam/Junk** folder.\n* If you experience any issues or have not received the invitation, please submit an ICT support request at **https://support.pmma.edu.ph/**.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 04:49:26','2026-06-29 07:03:09'),(2467,166,0,4,'Completed','I’m currently having trouble accessing the CHED OCDRA system since it requires Google Chrome. I tried installing it, but it iss asking for an admin password to proceed.','Successfully installed the Google Chrome browser application.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-29 05:02:55','2026-06-29 07:34:58'),(2468,167,5,4,'Completed','Request access to Canva pro and Foxit','# Canva Pro Registration Guide\n\nYour request for **Canva Pro** access has been approved. An invitation has been sent to your **official PMMA email address**.\n\n### How to Register\n\n1. Log in to your **PMMA official email account**.\n2. Open the email invitation from **Canva**.\n3. Click the **Accept Invitation** or **Join Team** button.\n4. Sign in using your **PMMA official email address**.\n\n   * If you do not have a Canva account yet, select **Sign Up** and create one using your PMMA email.\n5. Complete the registration process and accept the invitation.\n6. Once completed, you will have access to **Canva Pro** under the PMMA team.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n* Please use **only your PMMA official email address** to activate your Canva Pro account.\n* If you cannot find the invitation, check your **Spam/Junk** folder.\n* If you experience any issues 