. The probable cause is worn or deteriorated printheads. It is recommended to replace the printheads to restore normal print quality.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 00:10:39','2026-06-30 01:59:55'),(2472,729,0,2,'Completed','Cannot open desktop applications.','Temporarily run the programs in safe mode and observe future errors that may arise.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 00:31:39','2026-06-30 00:50:26'),(2473,6,3,3,'Completed','Printer output appears duplicated or misaligned on the page, resulting to unreadable documents.','Printer output remains duplicated or misaligned despite performing printer maintenance, indicating a likely defective printhead or a malfunction in the printer\'s carriage mechanism. The issue is hardware-related and cannot be resolved through routine maintenance.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 01:28:16','2026-07-28 06:51:46'),(2474,35,3,6,'Completed','Request to uninstall WPS application.','Uninstalled WPS application.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 02:00:22','2026-06-30 02:14:52'),(2475,121,3,3,'Completed',NULL,'Set up the printer for wireless printing and configured the computers to access the printer over the wireless network.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 02:15:14','2026-06-30 07:42:55'),(2476,228,0,6,'Completed','Request to reset the Gmail account password for jl.renolo@pmma.edu.ph.','Request successfully completed.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 02:23:36','2026-06-30 02:51:27'),(2477,730,5,6,'Completed','I would like to respectfully request access to a Canva Pro account for the Graduate School\'s official use. This will greatly assist us in creating high-quality posters, certificates, presentations, and other official publication and communication materials. Thank you.','Access has been approved','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 04:06:09','2026-07-02 02:30:30'),(2478,219,4,4,'Cancelled','Installation of OBS software.',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 04:36:58','2026-07-15 06:09:55'),(2479,184,4,4,'Cancelled','Installation of Adobe Photoshop',NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 04:37:28','2026-07-15 06:10:13'),(2480,105,4,6,'Completed','Inspection of the ff equipment for turnover: \r\n1.	APC AVR  [Note: (SPSS AVR)]\r\n2.	HP Laser Jet Pro 200 color M25in\r\n3.	 KEYBOARD','Upon inspection, all listed items were found to be unserviceable and are recommended for disposal in accordance with established property disposal procedures.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 07:41:44','2026-07-01 02:27:40'),(2481,105,4,6,'Completed','Inspection of APC UPS for turnover','Upon inspection and evaluation, the Uninterruptible Power Supply (UPS) was found to be defective and beyond economical repair. Due to its non-functional condition, the unit is recommended and ready for disposal.','10.40.0.10','2026-06-30 07:42:18','2026-07-01 02:25:39'),(2482,172,NULL,3,'Completed',NULL,NULL,'10.40.0.10','2026-07-01 00:54:46','2026-08-26 00:11:05'),(2483,3,5,6,'Completed','Date: July 1, 2026\r\n\r\nITSU\r\n\r\nSubject: Request for Official Use of Canva\r\n\r\nDear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI respectfully request approval for the official use of Canva by the Accounting Unit to support the preparation of professional and visually organized office documents, presentations, infographics, reports, and other information materials.\r\n\r\nThe use of Canva will enable the unit to produce clear, consistent, and well-designed materials for both internal and external communication. It will also improve the presentation of financial information, announcements, orientation materials, and other official documents while promoting efficiency and maintaining a professional standard in our outputs.\r\n\r\nThank you for your favorable consideration. I look forward to your positive response.\r\n\r\nRespectfully yours,\r\n\r\nCLOWIELYN G. VENTURA\r\nACCOUNTING UNIT','Access Granted','10.40.0.10','2026-07-01 02:45:02','2026-07-02 03:25:19'),(2484,558,0,6,'Completed','Cannot access my Outlook account due to password error.','Successfully reset the MS Office account password.','10.40.0.10','2026-07-01 03:07:42','202